[02:42.42]言詞若有錯
[02:45.26]不唱又如何
[02:48.50]mi mi mi so re re re mi re do do
[02:54.84]fa fa fa fa mi mi re do re do re la so
[03:00.85]mi mi so re re mi re do do la
